name 'pl-aif1-js-css-properties'
title 'title'
description 'description here'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Reading a CSS Rule</h1>

<p>You don't need to memorize what every CSS property does. You just need to recognize the shape of a rule: every single one breaks down into the same three pieces.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; margin: 20px 0;">

  <div style="padding-right: 16px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; background-color: #34bd43; display: inline-block;"></span>
      <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #1F1976; font-size: 15px;">Selector</span>
    </div>
    <p>Which HTML element to style, like <code>body</code> or <code>h1</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="padding: 0 16px; border-left: 1px solid #E4E2F8;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; background-color: #e62378; display: inline-block;"></span>
      <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #1F1976; font-size: 15px;">Property</span>
    </div>
    <p>What you want to change, like <code>color</code> or <code>margin</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="padding-left: 16px; border-left: 1px solid #E4E2F8;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; background-color: #0099f3; display: inline-block;"></span>
      <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #1F1976; font-size: 15px;">Value</span>
    </div>
    <p>How that property changes, like <code>blue</code> or <code>20px</code>.</p>
  </div>

</div>

---

<div style="width:100%; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:20px 0;">
<iframe src="https://amandadennard-dotcom.github.io/Unit5AIF2/see-css-rule-in-action.html" width="100%" height="620" style="border:none;" title="See a CSS Rule in Action: click to explore selector, property, and value"></iframe>
</div>

---

MARKDOWN
